  "label": "The menacing Black man is mapped as the perpetrator of the crime described in the text.",
  "description": "The visual of the Black man with a menacing expression is used to represent the person who committed the violent act described in the text 'i raped that mexican hard'. The visual material (the person) is mapped onto the textual material (the crime) to imply that the Black man is the criminal. This mapping leverages the anti-Black stereotype of criminality and aggression.",
